    "booking_eyebrow": "Wedding booking",
    "booking_title": "Book your Cleveland or Columbus wedding photo magnets.",
    "booking_intro": "Check your date, choose your guest-count tier and confirm your venue details before reserving live photo magnet service in Cleveland, Northeast Ohio or the Columbus area. Columbus-area travel is a flat $150.",
    "booking_start": "Check wedding availability & reserve",
    "booking_prices": "View guest-count pricing",
    "booking_step0_title": "Choose your guest-count tier",
    "booking_step0_body": "Select the collection matching your total guest count. Intimate includes three hours; Signature, Celebration, Grand and Premier include four. Every collection includes unlimited magnets during service, a photo station and a private gallery.",
    "booking_step1_title": "Select your date",
    "booking_step1_body": "Check the calendar and share your venue address, guest count, and event details. Confirm any travel charge before paying.",
    "booking_step2_title": "Reserve your celebration",
    "booking_step2_body": "Complete the reservation payment and required booking agreement. We’ll follow up on timing, design, and logistics.",
    "booking_ready": "A few details to have ready.",
    "date": "Event date",
    "venue": "Venue name & address",
    "guests": "Estimated guest count",
    "booking_payment_q": "How does the reservation payment work?",
    "booking_payment_a": "Your collection uses a 30% reservation retainer, applied toward the full price. The remaining balance is due according to your event agreement. Your date is reserved once the required agreement and payment are complete.",
    "booking_limits_q": "What should I know before booking?",
    "booking_limits_a": "Availability is limited to one primary event per date. Travel up to 40 driving miles from Strongsville is included. Columbus-area events have a flat $150 travel fee covering the round trip. Confirm your venue and travel total with us before paying the retainer. For 201–250 guests, contact us before paying your retainer so we can confirm production capacity, setup and any staffing requirements. Events for 251–300 guests start at {{ price }} and are booked by custom quote only; contact us to confirm your price and staffing before payment. Events above 300 guests require a custom quote.",
    "booking_next_q": "What happens after I reserve?",
    "booking_next_a": "We’ll follow up to confirm timing, setup, design, logistics, and any custom requests.",
    "booking_question": "Something special in mind?",
    "booking_inquire": "Tell us about your celebration",
    "faq_eyebrow": "A little clarity",
    "faq_title": "Wedding and custom photo magnet FAQs.",
    "faq_intro": "Find what you need for your celebration, your magnet order, or your keepsake.",
    "faq_nav": "Frequently asked question topics",
    "jump_events": "Events",
    "jump_magnets": "Magnet orders",
    "jump_keepsakes": "Keepsakes",
    "events_group": "Events",
    "event_what_q": "Do guests receive their magnets at the event?",
    "event_what_a": "Yes. We print and press photo magnets live at your venue. Guests pick up finished magnets during your booked service hours and take them home that night. Every guest-count package also includes a 12-pack made from the couple’s chosen wedding photos and shipped after the wedding. Additional magnets beyond those 12 and other keepsakes are optional paid purchases.",
    "event_only_q": "Do you work only with weddings?",
    "event_only_a": "Yes. Birthdays, showers, graduations, anniversaries and company celebrations are quoted individually. Visit Special events to share your date and details.",
    "event_availability_q": "How do I check my date?",
    "event_availability_a": "For weddings, choose your guest-count tier and check the booking calendar; larger weddings require a custom quote. For other celebrations, request availability and a personal quote on our Special events page.",
    "event_custom_q": "Can I customize the experience?",
    "event_custom_a": "Yes. Additional service time, presentation, artwork and after-event keepsakes can be tailored to your celebration. All guest-count tiers include unlimited magnets during the booked service hours.",
    "event_reserved_q": "When is my date reserved?",
    "event_reserved_a": "Your date is reserved once the required booking agreement and reservation payment are complete.",
    "faq_booking": "Check event availability",
    "magnets_group": "Magnet orders",
    "magnet_size_q": "What size are the magnets?",
    "magnet_size_a": "Our signature magnets measure 2.5 × 2.5 inches.",
    "magnet_event_q": "Can I order magnets without booking an event?",
    "magnet_event_a": "Yes. Order custom photo magnets directly from the shop in sets of 3, 6, 12, 24, or 48.",
    "magnet_upload_q": "How do I upload my photographs?",
    "magnet_upload_a": "Choose your set on the photo magnet product page, upload one image per magnet, and adjust your square crops before checkout.",
    "magnet_clear_q": "Which images should I choose?",
    "magnet_clear_a": "Use clear, high-resolution photographs and leave room around faces and important details for square cropping.",
    "faq_shop": "Create your magnets",
    "keepsakes_group": "Keepsakes",
    "keepsake_photos_q": "Do I need my wedding photographs when I order?",
    "keepsake_photos_a": "For the separately ordered Wedding Magnetic Keepsake Frame with Custom Magnets, photo selection happens after the wedding. Choose Wedding Night Photos, Your Wedding Photos, or A Mix of Both when ordering. Guest magnets included in a live event collection are made and picked up at the event.",
    "keepsake_link_q": "Where do I personalize my wedding keepsake?",
    "keepsake_link_a": "After your wedding, use the order-specific photo-selection or upload link provided by Atelier Elunora. If you have not received it, contact us with your order number. The personalization page explains the steps for each photo option.",
    "keepsake_time_q": "How long do I have to choose my photos?",
    "keepsake_time_a": "You may personalize your wedding keepsake within six months of your wedding date.",
    "keepsake_frame_q": "Is the main framed image selected separately?",
    "keepsake_frame_a": "Yes. Follow the instructions in your personalization email to select the main framed image separately from your magnet photographs.",
    "faq_personal": "View personalization steps",
    "faq_more": "Still have a question?",
